# Rename to CODEOWNERS and replace the handle once the repository is public.
#
# The bounded novelty statement and the source comparison are the artifacts a
# reader is trusting. PUBLISHING.md requires review before either changes, and
# this file is how that requirement is enforced rather than remembered.

*                   @GITHUB_HANDLE

/PRIOR_ART.md       @GITHUB_HANDLE
/RESEARCH.md        @GITHUB_HANDLE
/SOURCES.md         @GITHUB_HANDLE
/scripts/           @GITHUB_HANDLE
/tests/             @GITHUB_HANDLE
